From 65f1406f14044c53f4b8d5c6dadcae37f2ab5f12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:16:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(contact): slit-type title and a playhead-flood FAQ band

Retitle the section 'Got a hard one? Let's roll tape.' in slit type, and replace
the recall console with a full-bleed FAQ band: eight tracks that open with an
orange playhead sweep (dark copy of the row clipped in step, answer printed in
the dark), a DAW ruler, per-track level meters, pointer scrub line, search,
topic chips, deep links, an auto-opened first track and a no-JS fallback.
